  "reason": "No completed experiments exist, so the main uncertainty is whether a simple unimodal baseline is competitive before testing multiprofile, advanced encoders, or fusion. config_001 tests the simplest RNA-only, single-profile PCA setting, establishing a reference validation accuracy/F1 and isolating the RNA representation/profile baseline. It is the best next experiment because it is low-risk, avoids confounding multiple design choices, and creates an anchor for later comparisons of RNA encoders, aggregation, and multimodal fusion under a limited budget."
